      211         VIEW-AS TEXT
      212        SIZE 24.5 BY 1 NO-UNDO.
      213   DEFINE VARIABLE for-object AS CHARACTER FORMAT "X(40)"
      214         VIEW-AS TEXT
      215        SIZE 24.5 BY 1 NO-UNDO.
